{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13257","headline":"之京留别刘方平 · 皇甫冉","name":"之京留别刘方平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客子慕俦侣，含凄整晨装。\n邀欢日不足，况乃前期长。\n离袂惜嘉月，远还劳折芳。\n迟回越二陵，回首但苍茫。\n乔木清宿雨，故关愁夕阳。\n人言长安乐，其奈缅相望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}